WEBVTT

00:18:59.384 --> 00:19:00.844
Where is this heading?

00:19:00.844 --> 00:19:05.557
UŞ: What we have now is now
an approved technology

00:19:05.557 --> 00:19:07.767
and a first approved product.

00:19:07.809 --> 00:19:12.856
The development of the coronavirus
mRNA vaccine shows the power

00:19:12.856 --> 00:19:14.441
of the mRNA

00:19:14.441 --> 00:19:18.445
and it shows also
the safety of this approach.

00:19:18.486 --> 00:19:20.822
And it shows

00:19:20.822 --> 00:19:26.203
that it opens up a door for new technology

00:19:26.203 --> 00:19:28.205
and for new type of treatments.

00:19:28.538 --> 00:19:33.543
And the mRNA molecules